# Build context for infra/lambda-images/publisher/Dockerfile is the
# repository root (CDK's DockerImageCode.fromImageAsset, step 02-02, points
# at the repo root with the `file` option). `npm ci` runs INSIDE the image
# build against the linux/arm64 base image -- the host's node_modules is
# Darwin-built and must never be copied in; dist/build caches are
# regenerated fresh at build/render time and would only bloat the context.
node_modules
.git
cdk.out
dist
.astro
.pipeline-out
.ci-local-logs
